AS | id=2509.18928]\n  4. SpeechPrompt: Prompting Speech Language Models for Speech Processing Tasks\n     https://arxiv.org/abs/2408.13040\n     [authors=Kai-Wei Chang, Haibin Wu, Yu-Kai Wang, Yuan-Kuei Wu, Hua Shen, Wei-Cheng Tseng, Iu-thing Kang, Shang-Wen Li, Hung-yi Lee | published=2024-08-23 | primary_category=eess.AS | id=2408.13040]\n  5. Detecting Dementia from Speech and Transcripts using Transformers\n     https://arxiv.org/abs/2110.14769\n     [authors=Loukas Ilias, Dimitris Askounis, John Psarras | published=2021-10-27 | primary_category=cs.CL | id=2110.14769]\n\n=== openalex (5 results) ===\n  1. DiTAR: Diffusion Transformer Autoregressive Modeling for Speech Generation\n     https://openalex.org/W4407245114", "stderr": "", "interrupted": false, "isImage": false, "noOutputExpected": false}}
{"type": "assistant", "message": {"id": "msg_1785912241374", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "我已经掌握了足够的事实根据。主要发现：\n- Vevo2 (arXiv 2508.16332) 已在 paper-wiki 中确认，是离散 AR 的基线\n- YingMusic-Singer (arXiv 2603.24589) 已确认，即将在 Interspeech 2026 发表\n- MeloDISinger (arXiv 2606.30580) 已确认，是即将在 Interspeech 2026 发表的并发工作\n- SemaVoice (arXiv 2605.16964) 和 DiTAR (arXiv 2502.03930) 已确认，是连续 AR 语音的先前工作\n- EditSinger 已确认，是先前的 SVS 编辑工作\n- OMC wiki 中没有 SVS 编辑的条目"}], "model": "GLM-5.2-w4a8", "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 0, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0}, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "7244a64c-3b2d-44d3-8e96-d5bf65e1477f", "uuid": "10571998-ed8e-4a24-8234-3d78552ff97c"}
